    "text": "1. 19 winvestment Manager Recount\" shall mean that portion of the Trust: Fund which has’ been. segregated by the Trustees for. investment. management by. one. or more Investment. Manager(s)*,.. each of which shall. constitute | a | Separate Investment Manager. Account. 925°."
