 {"clause_id": "c026", "issues": [
   {"issue": "\"Plan\" is defined as rules \"from time to time adopted by the Board,\" which cannot be squared with the second recital's statement that the Collective Bargaining Agreements \"establish the Plan.\" A dispute over whether bargained terms are Plan terms would require reconciling the two.", "type": 2, "prob": 0.18}
