   {"issue": "The Board is given \"exclusive power and authority to exercise the powers set forth in Section 5.5\" over self-directed assets, duplicating Section 8.4(b), which states the same rule for assets as to which no Investment Manager has been appointed. The two overlapping grants leave unclear which governs assets an Investment Manager was appointed for but does not in fact manage.", "type": 2, "prob": 0.12}
 ]},
